    "user_request_original": "Design a 21-layer defect-cavity stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: 5 HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand) pairs, then one HfO2 defect layer, then 5 SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2 pairs (mirror symmetry around defect). Optimize defect layer thickness to center transmission peak at 1550 nm, and optimize surrounding mirror pair thicknesses for maximum visible reflectance. Initial defect thickness set to half-wave optical thickness at 1550 nm. Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from catalog. Substrate: SiO2 (Lemarchand) (fused silica). Incident medium: air. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized light.",
